 listed on the National Register of Historic Places, and the Cole Reading Room is designated for quiet study during the academic year.","source_url":"https://www.stlawu.edu/offices/alumni/360-degree-campus-tours","source_title":"360-Degree Campus Tours | St. Lawrence University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The Cole Reading Room is for individual desk work and reading; observe posted building access rules.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"slu-owen-d-young-library","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Owen D. Young Library","title":"Make Owen D. Young Library your study anchor","subtitle":"Saturday late morning • library stop","notes":"Find a study floor, then note the ground-floor meditation and prayer space for a quiet break between orientation tasks and new conversations.","short_summary":"Locate a reliable academic and quiet-space resource.","evidence_claim":"Owen D. Young Library has a ground-floor space with meditation cushions and prayer mats that students may use for breathing, meditation, and Muslim prayer.","source_url":"https://www.stlawu.edu/offices/wellness-education-office/wellness-zones","source_title":"Wellness Zones | St. Lawrence University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Library access and services may vary by academic calendar and campus ID status.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"slu-richard-f-brush-art-gallery","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Richard F. Brush Art Gallery","title":"Look for the current Brush Art Gallery exhibition","subtitle":"Saturday afternoon • campus art","notes":"Check the gallery’s current exhibition information before you go, then use the visit as an easy conversation starter with a new f