riend or roommate.","short_summary":"See rotating art on campus and take in a visual change of pace.","evidence_claim":"The Richard F. Brush Art Gallery is on campus and has a permanent collection of more than 7,000 objects alongside regularly rotating exhibitions.","source_url":"https://www.stlawu.edu/academics/programs/art-and-art-history","source_title":"Art and Art History | St. Lawrence University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Confirm current exhibition dates and gallery access before visiting.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"slu-north-country-garden","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"North Country Garden","title":"Take a breather in the North Country Garden","subtitle":"Saturday afternoon • Sykes Hall courtyard","notes":"Bring a water bottle or a book and use the garden for a short reset. It is intended as a quiet outdoor place to sit, eat, meditate, or study.","short_summary":"A designated campus spot for a gentle outdoor pause.","evidence_claim":"St. Lawrence identifies the North Country Garden near Sykes Hall as an outdoor space students may use to sit, meditate, eat lunch, or study.","source_url":"https://www.stlawu.edu/offices/wellness-education-office/wellness-zones","source_title":"Wellness Zones | St. Lawrence University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Outdoor use depends on weather and normal campus access conditions.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"slu-first-year-cup","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"First-Year Cup","title":"Join a First-Year Cup activity","subtitle":"Saturday • first-year tradition","notes":"Ask your First-Year Program or resident staff what Cup activity is next, then join the option that feels comfortable—games, trivia, banner making, or songs.","short_summary":"A school-specific way to meet peers during the opening days.","evidence_claim":"First-Year Cup begins in students’ first days on campus and includes lawn games, trivia, banner-designing, and song competition.","source_url":"https://www.stlawu.edu/academics/first-year-program","source_title":"First-Year Program | St. Lawrence University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Participation details and timing are set by the First-Year Program each semester.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"slu-backyard-adventures","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"Backyard Adventures","title":"Pick a Backyard Adventure","subtitle":"Saturday • first-week group outing","notes":"Choose a listed group outing that suits your energy and access needs. The program includes options such as hiking, screen-printing, pottery, escape rooms, and apple picking.","short_summary":"A structured way to explore the North Country with new people.","evidence_claim":"St. Lawrence’s First-Year Program describes Backyard Adventures as first-week group outings including screen-printing, escape rooms, hiking, pottery, virtual reality, ropes courses, and apple picking.","source_url":"https://www.stlawu.edu/academics/first-year-program","source_title":"First-Year Program | St. Lawrence University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Offerings, registration, transportation, and any fees vary by outing; confirm with the First-Year Program.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"slu-shared-sunday","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"Shared Sunday","title":"Close with a Shared Sunday activity","subtitle":"Sunday afternoon • connect beyond class","no